# Deploy without asking

The operator deploys with `git pull` on the VPS. Do not wait for «پوش کن» or «دستور وی پی اس».

When overlay, donate page, panel, or backend changes are done:

1. Commit the work (never `.env` or secrets).
2. `git push origin HEAD` to `main`.
3. Print VPS commands. Skip `migrate` unless a new migration exists:

```bash
cd /opt/atomic-donate
git pull
./venv/bin/python manage.py collectstatic --noinput
sudo systemctl restart atomic-donate
```

If overlays changed, remind: OBS Browser Source **Refresh**. If list size changed, resize the source (default ۲۲۰×۲۸۰).
